1
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:17,500
Cold raindrops tap as I step through your door,

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,500
I drop my wet coat on your dim wooden floor.

3
00:00:24,199 --> 00:00:29,800
His clammy hand pressed on my spine in the dark—

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Mama, I dance just to keep my own spark!

5
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:46,500
You won't see my spirit get broken in two,

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,799
I guard the bright fire I inherited from you.

7
00:00:53,299 --> 00:00:58,799
No dirty hand steals my soul or my name,

8
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:06,500
I won't turn to ash, I will protect the flame.

9
00:01:16,799 --> 00:01:22,200
You grip on my wrist as you look in my eyes,

10
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:28,000
To pull me away from the cold and the lies:

11
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:34,200
"Go to Mary Lier, she will see who you are,

12
00:01:34,799 --> 00:01:42,500
Find a true partner who reaches your star."

13
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:51,000
I hear your advice and I take back my space,

14
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:56,799
I'll break through the frost with my dignity and grace.

15
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:02,799
I'm stepping away from the shadow and shame,

16
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:11,199
Mama, I'm dancing to honor your flame.

17
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:26,199
No more creeping hands upon my spine,

18
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:31,800
This body and dance are forever mine.

19
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:37,500
I won't turn to ash in the dark and the cold—

20
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:45,500
Mama, I am the fire you held in your hold!